LOCUS       example_vRNA_eGFP       1021 bp    ss-RNA  linear   SYN 15-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  Example influenza vRNA segment carrying eGFP in place of the HA
            ectodomain, presented in mRNA sense. Runs from the 3' NCR (U12)
            through the 5' NCR (U13), inclusive.
